            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/AJP.0b013e31819e4ec0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Male chronic urogenital pain syndromes are difficult to manage. A comparably simple topical application of lidocaine offers us a potentially useful therapy for men with intractable testicular pain.</AbstractText>
